# Input
```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css">
</head>
<body>
	<!-- The stylesheet declares the class `foo+bar`; markup doesn't process escapes, so this is the class `foo\+bar`, which nothing declares. -->
	<div class="foo\+bar">Escaped in markup</div>
</body>
</html>

```

